    "name": "LoanLens API - Egyptian Loan Financial Advisor (Bilingual EN/AR)",
    "description": "Postman Collection for LoanLens Financial Advisory Engine.\n- Dual Language Support: English (Default) & Arabic (switch `lang` variable to `ar`).\n- OpenAPI Spec URL: http://localhost:5257/openapi/v1.json\n- Scalar Interactive UI: http://localhost:5257/scalar/v1",
